- V8 acceptance probe -> `pricing` and Arabic `تسعير` both return a pricing block in the top 3;
  30 blocks, 8 RTL, all 8 RTL blocks carry an Arabic tag

### Final state
Committed as the two-parent merge at the tip of this branch (first parent `db176f4`, the round-10
