No test was weakened, deleted or skipped. No secret committed. No forbidden path
(`docs/handoff/watchdog.ps1`, `qa/*.png`, `packages/tests/visual/baselines`, ZCode/Codex files)
touched. No Arabic text was written by this session; no mojibake placeholder text was added.

### Files
`.jdone` only (this report prepended to the preserved rollup). No source file was modified by this
