- `src/server/__tests__/mirofishHttp.test.ts`     -> tests 4, pass 4, fail 0
- `src/agent/__tests__/*.test.ts`                  -> tests 266, pass 265, fail 1
- `npm run check:modes` / `check:orchestrator`     -> PASS

The single agent-suite failure is the inherited, pre-existing `src/agent/__tests__/toolDescriptions.test.ts`
("suggest_plan is neither registered nor listed in PENDING_CODING_TOOLS"), byte-identical to manus-parity and
