(`8c1f149`) and therefore did not actually contain `26fcd6bb` in its ancestry, which would make
`git merge-base --is-ancestor manus-parity HEAD` fail. The tree was rebuilt as a genuine 2-parent
merge commit (parents `8c1f149` and `26fcd6bb`) with the identical tree, and the branch ref moved
to it. The reflog retains the original single-parent commit as a recoverable entry.

