  `classifyToolCall` at `src/policy/riskTier.ts:385-418`, `SECRET_TOOL_NAMES` at
  `:248-258`, gate callers at `src/policy/permissionModes.ts:471`,
  `src/policy/permissionRules.ts:281`, `src/tools/planApprovalGate.ts:120`.
  BUILD_SPEC §10 U6 decision A is correct.
- **U5** tool start/finish emit sites in `src/agent/loop.ts`: `tool_call` at `:488`/`:534`,
  `tool_result` at `:519-525`/`:548`. **The loop never captures `call.id`**, so O5 must
