# N9 - Ask-User-More node: DONE (merge gate resolved on the current parity tip)

## Outcome

The gate failure was not a code defect. `.jgatefail.txt` reported:

    MERGE CONFLICT with latest manus-parity: run git merge manus-parity, resolve all
    conflicts keeping both sides, commit.

`manus-parity` had advanced twice since the last N9 report (N2's canvas view, then
N10's output-type routing), so `.jdone` conflicted again. Both merges are now
resolved, committed, and every gate has been re-run on the resulting tree.

## What was done

