   No conflict: N9's files (`src/tools/askUser*.ts`, `src/server/routes/askUser.ts`,
   `src/protocol/*`) are disjoint from J5's `src/policy/commandRisk/*` and
   `src/tools/shell.ts`, and parity's prepended `.jdone` rollup auto-merged.
   `git rev-list --left-right --count manus-parity...HEAD` after this merge was `8 5`
   (8 parity commits still missing).
2. `git merge manus-parity` (parity tip `cf45585`, C19 failover endpoints + hermetic
