## A real regression found and fixed
The i18n catalogs are flat key->value maps, so appending a duplicate key silently
overwrites an existing UI string. An earlier merge had done exactly that:
- AR: `"Automation"` «الأتمتة» -> «أتمتة» and `"Media"` «وسائط» -> «إعلام» (two real
  regressions to existing UI strings).
- EN: 5 duplicate keys (`Automation`, `Website`, `Edit`, `Media`, `Research`,
  `Security`).
Both catalogs were rebuilt from their HEAD originals plus only genuinely new keys.
Result: 909 keys each, 0 removed, 0 changed, no duplicates. The test expectations were
updated from `'Loam Build · Max'` / `'Loam Write · Max'` to `'Build · Max'` /
`'Write · Max'`.
| 12 seeded flow templates | `flowTemplates.test.ts` "exposes exactly the 12 seeded flow ids" + "the catalog loads all 12 in order with unique ids" |
| all 12 pass the flow-template schema check | "all 12 flow JSON files pass the schema check" |
| required seed content (Nutrio en + ar, Arabic report, site, slides) | "seeds the required flows: Nutrio (en + ar), Arabic report, site, slides" |
| every template's mode/effort match a known Loam mode and effort | "every flow targets a real Loam mode and a valid effort level" |
| `GET /api/flow-templates` lists them, `/:id` reads one, 404 otherwise | "lists the 12 flows", "reads one flow by slug", "404s an unknown slug" |
| the flows load in the packaged bundle too | `dist/server.cjs` contains `__LOAM_FLOW_TEMPLATES__`; a standalone bundle check loads all 12 |
| web types | `(cd packages/web && npx tsc --noEmit)` | exit 0 |
| server build | `npm run build:server` | exit 0 (`dist/server.cjs` + pdf worker written) |
| web build | `(cd packages/web && npx next build)` | exit 0 (compiled successfully) |
| encoding | `npm run check:encoding` | OK (no BOM, no mojibake, all JSON valid) |
| modes | `npm run check:modes` | PASS |
| backend suite | `node --import tsx --test "src/**/*.test.ts"` | 2702 tests, 2702 pass, 0 fail |
| web suite | `(cd packages/web && npx vitest run)` | 80 files, 547 tests pass |
| N15 backend tests | `node --import tsx --test src/templates/__tests__/flowTemplates.test.ts` | 13 tests, 13 pass |
| N15 web tests | `(cd packages/web && npx vitest run src/components/home/__tests__/FlowPlaybook.test.tsx src/i18n)` | 25 tests, 25 pass |
(`docs/handoff/watchdog.ps1`, `qa/*.png`, `packages/tests/visual/baselines`,
ZCode/Codex files) touched. `git merge-base --is-ancestor manus-parity HEAD` exits 0.
- **i18n parity:** the 11 new keys exist in `en` and `ar` only. Any further locale
  needs the same keys.
- **Flow editing:** the gallery is read-only. Authoring, editing or starring a flow
  is not wired; the JSON files and the `validateFlowTemplates` seam are the place to
  add it.
- **Search quality:** the gallery filter is a folded substring match over
  title + description + prompt. No ranking, no fuzzy match.
- **N21 (Arabic/RTL):** the Arabic Nutrio flow carries real Arabic content, but the
  gallery chrome labels remain English-only beyond the 11 new keys.
